WEBVTT

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.500
Dad...

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:09.840
What's going on?

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.010
Is this some sort of sick joke?

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:14.180
It's not a joke at all.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:19.020
I'll put this prince who wandered into the wrong world to sleep.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.050
Just like I did his father.

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:22.250
What?

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.760
Delzaine knew exactly what happened to his brother.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.890
He was quite smart, that man.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.290
I see... I knew it.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.030
It was I who killed Alzerm.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.760
With this very gun.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.970
You're kidding...

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.900
You bastard!

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.090
Dammit! My Warp Relic!

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.970
Shun. Come to me.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:49.110
Don't do it, Shun!

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.910
Dad...

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:57.150
We may not be related, but you are still my precious son I brought into this world.

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:59.990
Come. Let's go home.

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.720
Mother is waiting for us.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:06.460
If you weren't Shun's father,
I'd kill you right here.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:10.900
Without your Warp Relic, what can you even do to me?

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.600
It's time to say goodbye.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.440
Run!

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.490
I never thought he'd somehow make it here...

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:55.640
<i>In the city without love</i> <i>only your smile remains.</i>

00:01:55.640 --> 00:02:05.640
<i>Hold me tight to crush the loneliness,</i> <i>it's all that stops these pains.</i>

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:16.030
<i>You're constrained by that limit.</i>
<i>Free yourself and break apart the chains.</i>

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:26.030
<i>It's all gonna burn on down.</i>
<i>Dance to the flames that consume the night.</i>

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:36.210
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright.</i>

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:46.730
<i>Dance to the end of the night.</i>

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:56.730
<i>The inferno rages on. It's almost</i> <i>as beautiful as you. Beautiful and bright. Dance!</i>

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:07.410
<i>In the city without love</i>

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:21.430
Where am I?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.470
What is this?

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.940
What happened to me?

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.970
I see you've woken up.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.310
How do you feel?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.620
Who are you?

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:46.760
For what purpose have you come here?

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.560
I... was in my research lab.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.230
Then I was pulled inside the light...

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:54.100
Was it you who helped me?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.630
By my brother's orders.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.800
If you're from the surface, he wants to speak with you.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.140
From the surface?

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:02.400
What do you mean? Where is this?

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.470
This is... Endora.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:11.410
"20: Past"

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:16.020
To think there really was another world on the surface.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.090
You call yourself Asanaga?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.160
Tell me how you came here.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:23.490
I was investigating a crystal excavated from ancient ruins,

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:28.000
using a device I developed through my own personal research.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.470
People on the surface have technology that advanced?

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.840
Yes.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:36.710
Though Endora is a marvelous place with beauty beyond measure,

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:42.310
the technology on the surface gives us much that Endora cannot.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:45.350
Oh? What things do you have?

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:48.850
For example, vehicles that quickly fly you great distances,

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.050
and devices that let you speak with people far away.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:55.320
Plus, weapons with incredible destructive power.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.850
Incredible power? Now that is intriguing.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.130
I am in your debt.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.340
Someday I'll repay you.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.070
You intend to return?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.240
Indeed.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.880
Because King Alzerm values my thoughts.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:18.010
Also, I'm curious to know more about this Endora as well.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:25.180
Amazing... This will be the discovery of the century.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:29.220
Do you remember the crystal you found?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:33.530
After analyzing and looking into it, it's nothing short of amazing.

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:35.190
It's a huge discovery.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:37.730
What's funny?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:42.200
Because. It's been forever since you've acted this excited.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.910
You're always so calm and serious.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:49.550
I can't help it. This is that big of a discovery.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.280
Really? Why?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:56.620
I can't say right now, but this time for sure, people will admire my work.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.920
Asanaga Lab may be a small workshop now,

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:02.390
but soon it will be one of the largest companies in the world.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.590
That would be quite impressive.

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.800
But even if no one else sees it, you'll always be a wonderful scientist to me.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:16.610
It's because you believe in me that I've been able to come this far.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:20.640
With this discovery,
I'll be able to give us a better life.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:23.750
For you, and our child in here.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.450
Thank you.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:28.420
But, don't push yourself too hard, okay?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.250
Our child needs you, too.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.480
Yes... I know.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:36.760
Makiko!

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.660
Makiko?

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.100
Your wife is healthy, however...

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.290
The child...

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.640
Makiko...

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:49.570
Honey... I'm sorry...

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.950
So the surface has neither
Warp Relics nor Warp Particles?

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:03.650
Correct. I was very surprised when I learned of their existence.

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:08.290
To a scientist like me, your Warp Particles are of special interest.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.930
Then Endora has something the surface does not.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:14.460
We are not surpassed in every aspect it seems.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:17.830
Of course. Endora is a wonderful country.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:23.370
Your lush nature and the sparkle of Adamas is beautiful beyond measure.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.810
Mmm. I agree.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.140
I can light that.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.020
What is that?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:37.820
It is called a lighter.
It's a tool that produces fire.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.320
It works using a concept similar to flint.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:42.120
Oh?

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:44.490
If you like, I can give it to you.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:45.890
Are you sure?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.160
Oh!

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:54.400
The more I learn about it, the greater the surface seems.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.840
Father!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.380
Lord Emilio! You mustn't!

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:02.400
It's okay, Emilio.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.020
Up you go.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.720
Who?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.550
You don't remember?

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.890
It's your father's friend, Asanaga.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.320
It's been a while, Lord Emilio.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:19.500
Asa... naga?

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.870
You were just an infant when you met him last.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:28.040
By the way, Asanaga.
Didn't you have a child on the way?

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.670
Yes... Thanks for remembering.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:34.410
I see. You should bring them to Endora someday.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:37.880
You can make a friend from the surface, Emilio.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:39.110
Surface?

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.510
That's right.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.720
How do you like this surface technology?

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:49.020
The surface is great!

00:08:49.020 --> 00:08:50.430
I know, Delzaine.

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:55.060
Why don't you have Asanaga cure your son's ailment?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.700
Medicine isn't my field of expertise.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:09:00.100
Is something wrong with your son?

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:05.610
Yes... My son born just last year fell sick in an outbreak.

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:09.140
His son was born with a weak constitution.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.210
Much different from Emilio here.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.750
I see.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:17.290
It's true that the surface's medicine may be able to save him.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:21.320
Right now, all we can do is watch as he worsens.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:26.230
Instead, why don't you let
Asanaga care for him there?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.130
I want nothing more than to help my son.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:30.430
However...

00:09:30.430 --> 00:09:35.000
I'm sure Lord Delzaine is reluctant to part with his son.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:41.810
If we're allowed to restore the ancient ruins of Babel, he could come together with me to the surface.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.780
You... You're saying you can restore it?

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.420
Of course. I'm a scientist after all.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:53.590
And if Babel is operational, you could bring loads of supplies and technology here from the surface.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:55.190
Really?!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:59.130
Then Endora becoming as great as the surface isn't a far-fetched dream!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:00.960
Brother, you mustn't.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:04.800
Babel cannot be opened.
The sayings of old warn us against it.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:10.970
It's merely a suggestion to save your son and to help advance Endora.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.770
Though, were it to come true...

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.040
The name of King Alzerm would reverberate throughout history

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:19.650
as the king who made Endora prosper.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:22.550
Oh! It may! It may just!

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:42.030
Brother is a changed man ever since Asanaga arrived.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.710
Take care of my son.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.050
You need not worry.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:57.320
With proper treatment from the surface,
I'm sure we can cure your son.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.220
Please do.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.420
Leave it to me.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.430
Well done, Asanaga!

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:07.230
Only someone as talented as you could restore Babel so quickly.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.100
Thank you.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.900
I'd like to reward you for your exemplary work.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:13.840
Is there anything you desire?

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.670
It's enough reward to be of service to you.

00:11:17.670 --> 00:11:20.040
Don't hold back. Just speak it.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:22.440
We are friends, you and I.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.720
Then, I do have one suggestion...

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:30.620
Is it true that you plan to take my brother to the surface?

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:36.260
Asanaga. Do not bewitch my brother any further.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:38.530
Why do you badmouth me?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:42.230
I am simply fulfilling the king's desires.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:49.100
It's obvious the civilization on the surface is leagues beyond ours.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:53.910
However, Endora is beautiful and prosperous enough as it is.

00:11:53.910 --> 00:11:58.250
Obtaining power beyond our reach will destroy everything we have.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:03.050
If you wish to stop Alzerm so much, why don't you become the king?

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:08.320
Yes... You could kill him.
No one would even bat an eye.

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:09.760
You bastard!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:24.610
If you kill me with that sword, you'll be banished, just like a filthy Zoozian.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.100
You... and your son, too.

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:30.780
Don't worry, I'll soon be gone.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:33.510
Once I obtain what I'm after.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:44.260
You bastard! You'll betray me?

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.260
Betray? It's not betrayal...

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.700
Why do it?!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.500
Because I planned to use you from the start.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.440
You bastard!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.950
Brother!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:11.820
Asanaga! What have you done?!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:15.360
I no longer have any use for Alzerm or Endora.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.380
Babel is now closed.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.160
It's time to say goodbye.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:29.040
Wait! Give me back my son!

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.370
If you care for your son, you can come and get him.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:07.510
I'm sorry.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.440
What are you sorry for?

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.380
I gave you a bitter memory.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.750
That's... It's the same for you.

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:25.590
Even if he says I'm not his son...
It's hard to believe it.

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:28.300
I don't even want to.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.730
Dammit.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.270
"I won't be able to come home tonight.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.270
Shun came to visit."

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.380
Welcome home. You're awful la--

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.720
Um...

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:57.320
Come in. Tell me what happened inside.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:06.940
Yes... It's true what he said.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:10.440
You knew about Endora this whole time?

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:13.410
He never told me anything, but...

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.610
Deep inside, I knew that's what it was.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:17.280
Then...

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:22.020
Then, you and Dad both tricked me and never told me anything?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.510
Is it because we're not family?!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.820
You're wrong, Shun.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.090
You are really our son.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:34.620
Ever since the very first day you came here.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:58.020
Welcome home.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.350
I'm back...

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.190
"Asanaga"

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.390
Honey? That child...

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.050
He's sick. I'm taking him to the hospital.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:10.690
He's suffering. How sad...

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:24.340
Up you go!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.510
Wee!

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:30.050
Hey... Shouldn't you take him back?

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:32.320
Are you fine with that? Really?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.560
Even though he's so attached to you.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.730
This child would have died.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:45.030
It has to be fate that he came to us.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.040
Yes...

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:58.380
When it came time, I couldn't let go of you.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.780
Mom...

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.080
I'm sorry.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:06.540
If I cared about your happiness,
I should have sent you back to Endora.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.960
I'm sorry...

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.930
Don't say that.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.030
Shun...

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:17.130
Don't make it sound like I've never been happy!

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:21.800
You and Dad are irreplaceable to me!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.440
So don't say you're sorry.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.640
I... I love my kind Mom that
I can talk about anything to.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:31.380
He might be a lab rat, but I love how Dad cares so much about family.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:37.050
With the three of us, not once have I ever been unhappy.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.320
Shun... Thank you.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:42.310
I'm so glad to be your mother.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:47.090
And yet, why did he...

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.470
Shun, hold out your hand.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.510
What about it?

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:59.410
This was in my room.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:03.340
The first day he brought you, this was attached to you.

00:18:03.340 --> 00:18:05.900
I'm sure it's something important.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.650
Shun.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.620
That crest is for relatives of royalty.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.120
Royalty?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.820
You and I... are cousins.

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.800
Then, my real father was...

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.200
Yeah.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.830
Isn't he your son?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.770
He is my son.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.840
It can't be...

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:34.880
Delzaine must have realized it himself.

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:37.210
That you were his real son.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.890
Can't sleep?

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.490
I just don't know anymore.

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.660
About Endora royalty...

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:53.290
About Delzaine being my real father...

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.790
This is one of my early memories...

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:01.870
Sick? Will he get better?

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:05.240
I'm sure Delzaine will help him recover.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:08.870
Once he does, you'll be able to play together.

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:17.550
Don't worry! We can play together soon!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:23.150
That day, in that castle full of adults,
I felt like I made my first friend.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:28.430
Delzaine was desperate, trying everything to save you.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.520
But in the end, he gave you to Asanaga.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.830
But it worked out.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.940
Delzaine met you in the end.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:43.110
Even though he was blamed for killing his brother and despised by me...

00:19:43.110 --> 00:19:47.550
He never gave up on his dream of finding his son.

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.620
And it came true.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.050
I-I...

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.260
It's natural to be confused.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:58.090
But to you, your real parents are the ones you've had.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:03.530
But, back there my father wasn't the one I know.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:06.600
Asanaga killed my father...

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.540
It was I who killed Alzerm.

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.940
No...

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:13.880
My dad... isn't a murderer.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.970
Dad...

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.440
Why?

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.590
"To be continued..."

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:13.500
<i>I've walked very far, so far</i>

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:23.000
<i>And I'll walk even farther from here</i>

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:45.800
<i>I don't wish for everything to stay the same</i>

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:55.800
<i>Because change is what got me to where I am</i>

00:21:56.410 --> 00:22:04.990
<i>We've walked very far, so far</i>

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>We'll go farther than anyone's gone before</i>

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:22.100
<i>Each of us can change the world</i>

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:31.270
<i>That's why I smile at you</i>
